Error [E0204]: `clock` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> builtin_mut_receiver_uses_two_phase_reservation_4.jet:4:26
    |
  4 |     &clock.advance(clock.now())
    |                          ^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&clock`) only once, or copy first with `~clock`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204

